<title>GERMANY: Boss says 1996 profit, sales both rise.</title>
<headline>Boss says 1996 profit, sales both rise.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   75.2    vs 58.0</p>
<p>    Group sales				  995.3   up 10.5 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German men's fashion retailing group is Hugo Boss AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
